 steps that they really want to  be doing are they trying to reach new  audiences are they trying to broadcast  online what are the things are trying to  go into and what's missing for them to  be able to do that and then develop a  solution that is going to allow them to  do that to overcome whatever it is  they're trying to overcome next it's  possible that want to buy this I don't  know I'm not an expert in international  radio station business models but I can  tell you that if you start with the  product and then look for the need often  you end up with a product and no sales  whereas we start with the need and then  build a product most of the time you're  going to have someone who's going to  want to buy it so I hope that was  helpful to you Ronald and to everyone  else was watching Russ Ronald if you  have any further questions or want to  explore this a little further you can  find me a fire pole marketing com and in  the meantime I wish everyone lots of  success and I'll see you all in the next  video  so run of a hope that was useful for you  I hope my advice and danny's from  fireball marketing was was useful and  you can go home and implement that into  your business if you guys liked the  video please give it a thumbs up and it  also love to hear your thoughts and  feedback if you want to leave a comment  under this video and stay tuned for the  next episode
 

